silm:instances_papers_00_whitepaper_chapters_02_twelve_leg_deep_dive_sections_07_role_leg_concrete_anchor#petrole silm:hasLongDescription "The PetRole is PetRole: the social role node expressing that Mittens is a patient at Tartu Animal Clinic; typed as BFO:0000023 (role); distinct from the biological classification DomesticCat and from the individual Mittens." .
