silm:instances_papers_00_whitepaper_chapters_02_twelve_leg_deep_dive_sections_07_role_leg_concrete_anchor#rolearrow_pet silm:hasLongDescription "The RoleArrow_Pet is RoleArrow_Pet: the typed arrow PetRole -> MittensColimitApex; distinct from classification_leg (DomesticCat -> MittensColimitApex). In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'role_leg', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
